- Listed MCP servers (user-installed, not bundled): arhancanli/canli-mcp (MIT), bcosm/backtester-mcp (Apache-2.0), atilaahmettaner/tradingview-mcp (MIT), YichengYang-Ethan/oracle3-prediction-market-agent (Apache-2.0).

